rom?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_975","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID459","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID46","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to give my wife's daughter money? My wife a","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for not wanting to give my wife&#x27;s daughter money? My wife and I married when her daughter was 17. She doesn&#x27;t view me as her step father or any sort of father figure and I respect that.\n\nMy wife and I have one child who my wife stays home with. Her daughter (now 23) is now moving into an apartment and needs money for a deposit. My wife wants me to pay it but I think I shouldn&#x27;t have to. I think this is for my wife and her ex to figure out. My wife argued that I should pay it because she doesn&#x27;t make an income but she should have discretionary use of our funds. I think she&#x27;s being absolutely ridiculous; I have no problem spending money on my own child or with my wife spending a reasonable amount of money on herself, but giving away $800 to her kid is a major ask. Am I wrong for saying no?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_1672","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to give my wife's daughter money? My wife a","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID46","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID460","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_975","QuestionID":"QID460","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID461","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a c","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a casual game of Trivial Pursuit - on the final question to win, I believe my answer should have been accepted.\n\nThe question was &quot;First revealed in 2008 by NASA, via the mission&#x27;s official Twitter account, the Phoenix lander discovered what on Mars?&quot;\n\nI answered water.\n\nThe back of the card reads &quot;Ice - The Tweet read &quot;We have ICE!!!! Yes, ICE, &quot;WATER ICE&quot; on Mars!&quot;\n\nThey said the answer is ice and didn&#x27;t agree with my argument that the tweet says water in it and they are being too pedantic.\n\nI got irritated and was accused of being a bad sport and ruining the atmosphere.\n\nHit me with your judgement.<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_3690","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a c","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID461","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID462","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_3690","QuestionID":"QID462","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID463","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a c","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a casual game of Trivial Pursuit - on the final question to win, I believe my answer should have been accepted.\n\nThe question was &quot;First revealed in 2008 by NASA, via the mission&#x27;s official Twitter account, the Phoenix lander discovered what on Mars?&quot;\n\nI answered water.\n\nThe back of the card reads &quot;Ice - The Tweet read &quot;We have ICE!!!! Yes, ICE, &quot;WATER ICE&quot; on Mars!&quot;\n\nThey said the answer is ice and didn&#x27;t agree with my argument that the tweet says water in it and they are being too pedantic.\n\nI got irritated and was accused of being a bad sport and ruining the atmosphere.\n\nHit me with your judgement.<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_3690","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for raging at family game night? My family and I played a c","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID463","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute"