xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID545","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong if I won't clean the house if I pay bills? Hey I'm 18 years","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong if I won&#x27;t clean the house if I pay bills? Hey I&#x27;m 18 years old and me and my mom got into it over me cleaning the house. She says I should wash the dishes or clean the bathroom since I&#x27;m still a &quot;kid&quot; but half my check literally goes to her or the house at least once a month sometimes more. I have two little sisters and a little brother who are all capable of cleaning and they don&#x27;t work. I&#x27;m not gonna lie I don&#x27;t work everyday but I do go to school as well. So Am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_602","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong if I won't clean the house if I pay bills? Hey I'm 18 years","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID545","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID546","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_602","QuestionID":"Q