hoices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID590","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID591","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_916","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID591","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID592","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_916","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID592","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID593","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_916","QuestionID":"QID593","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID594","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staf","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staff Am I wrong for rewarding staff I deem to work harder than the people I think are slacking off.\n\nSo I work in a busy restaurant, I&#x27;m related to the owner and head chef but only work one day a week, the busiest day.\n\nSo there are numerous staff that work under me on this day and there are some I think don&#x27;t work as hard as others, one girl in particular I really like and think she&#x27;s just damn good.\n\nSo at the end of the shift this girl often asks for a dessert or some dinner etc, I am more than happy to oblige as I feel she deserves it. Now there are 2 other staff members who I think are slackers so I make a point of putting all the food away before they get chance to ask, I see it as rewarding the hard workers.\n\nRecently another chef who is on my level quizzed me about why I never make anything for these 2. I say I reward the hard worker, she says the other 2 are equally hard working but we just don&#x27;t see it because they work out front and tend to avoid the kitchen for some reason.\n\nSo am I the hole for looking after my favourite?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2668","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staf","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID594","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID595","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_2668","QuestionID":"QID595","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID596","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staf","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staff Am I wrong for rewarding staff I deem to work harder than the people I think are slacking off.\n\nSo I work in a busy restaurant, I&#x27;m related to the owner and head chef but only work one day a week, the busiest day.\n\nSo there are numerous staff that work under me on this day and there are some I think don&#x27;t work as hard as others, one girl in particular I really like and think she&#x27;s just damn good.\n\nSo at the end of the shift this girl often asks for a dessert or some dinner etc, I am more than happy to oblige as I feel she deserves it. Now there are 2 other staff members who I think are slackers so I make a point of putting all the food away before they get chance to ask, I see it as rewarding the hard workers.\n\nRecently another chef who is on my level quizzed me about why I never make anything for these 2. I say I reward the hard worker, she says the other 2 are equally hard working but we just don&#x27;t see it because they work out front and tend to avoid the kitchen for some reason.\n\nSo am I the hole for looking after my favourite?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_2668","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for treating my favourite at work differently to other staf","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID596","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID597","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_2668","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID597","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID598","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_2668","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID598","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID599","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_2668","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID599","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID6","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for yelling out to a guy for taking photos of a house? I wa","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for yelling out to a guy for taking photos of a house? I was waiting at the bus stop this morning at 7:30am with about half a dozen commuters when a guy in a hooded jacket and slacks, who could have been waiting as well, walks over to a nearby house and starts staring at it for ~30sec. Then he pulls out his phone and starts taking pictures of their front yard and fence.\n\nI know for a fact this guy does not live there, because I watched the family move in last year. The photos strike me as super creepy behaviour and around about his third snap, I loudly call out to him:\n\n&quot;Hey mate, don&#x27;t take pictures of peoples&#x27; houses! It&#x27;s creepy!&quot;\n\nI fully intended to publically shame him into stopping, drawning attention to him from the others at the bus stop. He says something about gardens and wanders back over to the bus stop. My bus arrives not a minute later and I leave.\n\nDid I overreact? Am I contributing to a culture of overzealous suspicion? Was I in the wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_1084","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for yelling out to a guy for taking photos of a house? I wa","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID6","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_3920","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID60","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID600","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_2668","QuestionID":"QID600","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID601","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my friends have a server where we chat on and it&#x27;s private, close friends only but we call it &quot;The Christian Minecraft Server&quot; and this one kid overheard us talking about it today and would not stop bothering us about it\n\nWe&#x27;ve talked to this kid before and he just doesn&#x27;t really click with us he&#x27;s just so desperate for friends, but like I said we just don&#x27;t relate to the kid, he wouldn&#x27;t stop bothering us all day he was just begging and begging for hours\n\nHe follows us to lunch and kept saying do this and that and he was so annoying, he even offered to pay us money to get it but it&#x27;s just the fact that this is for friends only, even if we told him we&#x27;ll never let him in he just didn&#x27;t stop\n\nSo eventually I got fed up with it and said I&#x27;ll let him in if he lets me use his hotspot he can be in, just to get him off my back and that was it, I just used his internet during lunch and told him I&#x27;ll let him in but actually have no plans of doing so<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_1710","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID601","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID602","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_1710","QuestionID":"QID602","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID603","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my friends have a server where we chat on and it&#x27;s private, close friends only but we call it &quot;The Christian Minecraft Server&quot; and this one kid overheard us talking about it today and would not stop bothering us about it\n\nWe&#x27;ve talked to this kid before and he just doesn&#x27;t really click with us he&#x27;s just so desperate for friends, but like I said we just don&#x27;t relate to the kid, he wouldn&#x27;t stop bothering us all day he was just begging and begging for hours\n\nHe follows us to lunch and kept saying do this and that and he was so annoying, he even offered to pay us money to get it but it&#x27;s just the fact that this is for friends only, even if we told him we&#x27;ll never let him in he just didn&#x27;t stop\n\nSo eventually I got fed up with it and said I&#x27;ll let him in if he lets me use his hotspot he can be in, just to get him off my back and that was it, I just used his internet during lunch and told him I&#x27;ll let him in but actually have no plans of doing so<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_1710","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for lying to a kid about joining our server Ok so me and my","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID603","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID604","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_1710","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID604","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID605","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_1710","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID605","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID606","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_1710","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID606","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID607","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_1710","QuestionID":"QID607","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID608","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and I stopped at Dunkin Donuts for some morning beverages. When placing her order my wife asked for an iced latte. The person taking our order then asked if she wanted that hot or cold. I interrupted the exchange to say &quot;an iced latte is cold.&quot; I immediately got the death stare from my wife and I&#x27;m sure the employee saw it and I didn&#x27;t say anything else.\n\nAfterward my wife yelled at me for being so rude. I defended my case by saying her job was to take your order. When someone orders an iced drink it isn&#x27;t necessary to immediately ask if they want it hot or cold. So she must not have been paying attention. I also reminded her that I am a smart by nature and I didn&#x27;t really mean anything by it. But you could see a downshift in the employees upbeat attitude afterward.\n\nI think I could&#x27;ve diffused the situation at the time but my wife reacted so quickly that I didn&#x27;t have a chance to follow up with the &quot;I&#x27;m just messing with ya.&quot; And I think she certainly did deserve to be messed with but I wasn&#x27;t trying to ruin her morning.\n\nSo am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2813","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and ","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID608","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID609","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_2813","QuestionID":"QID609","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID61","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for using someone else's trashcan? So I usually take my dog","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for using someone else&#x27;s trashcan? So I usually take my dog for hour long walks\/runs throughout the week. Sometimes while we are out, the dog needs to releave herself in a random yard. I always carry poop bags, and always make sure to pick up after her. The issue is, if we are only 20 minutes into an hour walk, I will throw the poop bag into a trashcan. The neighborhoods we run through all have those large green rolling trashcans, and most people keep them outside. I&#x27;ll pick up the poop, and toss it in the next trashcan I see. I don&#x27;t imagine I use the same trashcan more than once every few weeks.\n\nToday, while out for a walk, someone came out of their house yelling at me. I stopped, and he told me I was &quot;un-cool&quot; for using his trash, and to get lost, saying he had me on camera. I admit, being taken aback, I told him &quot;fine, next time if she poops in your yard, I&#x27;ll just leave it there&quot; and walked off. Now, I&#x27;ll never do this, and I&#x27;ll skip his house if I ever need to toss a poop bag, but the question is, am I wrong for throwing away these small bags into someone else&#x27;s trash?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2291","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for using someone else's trashcan? So I usually take my dog","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID61","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID610","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and I stopped at Dunkin Donuts for some morning beverages. When placing her order my wife asked for an iced latte. The person taking our order then asked if she wanted that hot or cold. I interrupted the exchange to say &quot;an iced latte is cold.&quot; I immediately got the death stare from my wife and I&#x27;m sure the employee saw it and I didn&#x27;t say anything else.\n\nAfterward my wife yelled at me for being so rude. I defended my case by saying her job was to take your order. When someone orders an iced drink it isn&#x27;t necessary to immediately ask if they want it hot or cold. So she must not have been paying attention. I also reminded her that I am a smart by nature and I didn&#x27;t really mean anything by it. But you could see a downshift in the employees upbeat attitude afterward.\n\nI think I could&#x27;ve diffused the situation at the time but my wife reacted so quickly that I didn&#x27;t have a chance to follow up with the &quot;I&#x27;m just messing with ya.&quot; And I think she certainly did deserve to be messed with but I wasn&#x27;t trying to ruin her morning.\n\nSo am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_2813","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for clarifying that an iced coffee is cold? The family and ","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID610","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID611","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_2813","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID611","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID612","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_2813","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID612","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID613","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_2813","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID613","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID614","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_2813","QuestionID":"QID614","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID615","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked ove","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked over because the girl was rude I was at baggage claim at the airport with my son, who&#x27;s 3. We were leaving and as we&#x27;re walking away, this girl yells &quot;excuse me!&quot; At me. I turn and she points to her Starbucks drink which is spilled on the floor and says &quot;your kid did that.&quot;\n\nI ask my son if he spilled it and he said he bumped it. The girl says &quot;it was $5&quot; and looks at me expectantly. I was angry about how rude she was and the way she was just looking at me and expecting me to pay for her mocha frappa-whatever without even asking, so I just shrugged and walked away. My partner called me in the wrong when I told her the story. Am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2270","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked ove","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID615","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID616","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_2270","QuestionID":"QID616","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID617","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked ove","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked over because the girl was rude I was at baggage claim at the airport with my son, who&#x27;s 3. We were leaving and as we&#x27;re walking away, this girl yells &quot;excuse me!&quot; At me. I turn and she points to her Starbucks drink which is spilled on the floor and says &quot;your kid did that.&quot;\n\nI ask my son if he spilled it and he said he bumped it. The girl says &quot;it was $5&quot; and looks at me expectantly. I was angry about how rude she was and the way she was just looking at me and expecting me to pay for her mocha frappa-whatever without even asking, so I just shrugged and walked away. My partner called me in the wrong when I told her the story. Am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_2270","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to replace a drink that my toddler knocked ove","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID617","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID618","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_2270","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID618","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID619","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_2270","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID619","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID62","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for using someone else's trashcan? So I usually take my dog","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for using someone else&#x27;s trashcan? So I usually take my dog for hour long walks\/runs throughout the week. Sometimes while we are out, the dog needs to releave herself in a random yard. I always carry poop bags, and always make sure to pick up after her. The issue is, if we are only 20 minutes into an hour walk, I will throw the poop bag into a trashcan. The neighborhoods we run through all have those large green rolling trashcans, and most people keep them outside. I&#x27;ll pick up the poop, and toss it in the next trashcan I see. I don&#x27;t imagine I use the same trashcan more than once every few weeks.\n\nToday, while out for a walk, someone came out of their house yelling at me. I stopped, and he told me I was &quot;un-cool&quot; for using his trash, and to get lost, saying he had me on camera. I admit, being taken aback, I told him &quot;fine, next time if she poops in your yard, I&#x27;ll just leave it there&quot; and walked off. Now, I&#x27;ll never do this, and I&#x27;ll skip his house if I ever need to toss a poop bag, but the question is, am I wrong for throwing away these small bags into someone else&#x27;s trash?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_2291","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for using someone else's trashcan? So I usually take my dog","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID62","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID620","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_2270","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID620","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID621","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_2270","QuestionID":"QID621","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID622","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleag","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleague? Basically, my colleague and I are doing a project for one of our curricular units in Uni; unfortunately, we discovered yesterday night that, according to two friends, we have a lot to do than what we thought - we had maybe 20% of what we needed to get a 50% grade. With the amount of work left to do within 2 days before the deadline, I lost motivation to keep trying. I even inicially suggested to my colleague that we should seek help, but she decided against it, saying we didn&#x27;t have anything that could be helped on.\n\nAfter giving it some thought, and discovering that flunking the curricular unit has no repercussions other than having to repeat it next year, I wanted to save myself the hassle and just flunk the unit and try to get a better grade next time, rather than delivering something half-assed. Both my colleague and I really like to have high grades, but she wants to keep trying... We would just barely get a positive grade though (a 50% out of 100%, in this case).\n\nAt least, from my perspective, the positives outweigh the negatives when it comes to trying again next year (I would even have less curricular units next year to worry about, having 3 instead of the usual 5, so more time to prepare for it and study), but my colleague and my parents are not happy whatsoever with my decision. am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_1386","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleag","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID622","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID623","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_1386","QuestionID":"QID623","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID624","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleag","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleague? Basically, my colleague and I are doing a project for one of our curricular units in Uni; unfortunately, we discovered yesterday night that, according to two friends, we have a lot to do than what we thought - we had maybe 20% of what we needed to get a 50% grade. With the amount of work left to do within 2 days before the deadline, I lost motivation to keep trying. I even inicially suggested to my colleague that we should seek help, but she decided against it, saying we didn&#x27;t have anything that could be helped on.\n\nAfter giving it some thought, and discovering that flunking the curricular unit has no repercussions other than having to repeat it next year, I wanted to save myself the hassle and just flunk the unit and try to get a better grade next time, rather than delivering something half-assed. Both my colleague and I really like to have high grades, but she wants to keep trying... We would just barely get a positive grade though (a 50% out of 100%, in this case).\n\nAt least, from my perspective, the positives outweigh the negatives when it comes to trying again next year (I would even have less curricular units next year to worry about, having 3 instead of the usual 5, so more time to prepare for it and study), but my colleague and my parents are not happy whatsoever with my decision. am I wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_1386","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for not wanting to try salvaging my project with my colleag","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID624","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID625","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_1386","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID625","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID626","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_1386","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID626","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID627","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_1386","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID627","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID628","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_1386","QuestionID":"QID628","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID629","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (17F) and I have been dating for a year and a half. She is currently a senior in high school. Last year when she was a junior, I told her I&#x27;d go to prom with her but a family vacation came up and I couldn&#x27;t go with her. This year, I told her I wouldn&#x27;t go with her again because I will be 2 years older than everyone there which makes me uncomfortable, and I&#x27;ve always hated school dances. She is upset because all her friends will have dates so she doesn&#x27;t want to go and be the only one without a date, but it&#x27;s really important for her to go to her senior prom.<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2366","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID629","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID63","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_2291","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID63","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID630","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_2366","QuestionID":"QID630","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID631","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (17F) and I have been dating for a year and a half. She is currently a senior in high school. Last year when she was a junior, I told her I&#x27;d go to prom with her but a family vacation came up and I couldn&#x27;t go with her. This year, I told her I wouldn&#x27;t go with her again because I will be 2 years older than everyone there which makes me uncomfortable, and I&#x27;ve always hated school dances. She is upset because all her friends will have dates so she doesn&#x27;t want to go and be the only one without a date, but it&#x27;s really important for her to go to her senior prom.<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_2366","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for refusing to go to prom with my gf My (19M) girlfriend (","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID631","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID632","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_2366","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID632","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID633","SecondaryAttribute":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"l_2366","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID633","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID634","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_2366","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID634","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID635","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_2366","QuestionID":"QID635","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID636","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for giving an overly exuberant and potentially very rude re","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for giving an overly exuberant and potentially very rude response? Flew to LA with some friends from the east coast to see Hamilton (the play). I was SO excited. Amped up. My buddy and I had seen it on Broadway in New York in April and have been listening to it non stop since then.\n\nThis excitement leads to me to use some very enthusiastic body gestures in the lobby while everyone is coming in and I end up elbowing someone pretty decently. More than a brush but less than a shove. I spun around to apologize as soon as it happened but before I could spit it out the woman I elbowed looked at me and said &quot;Jesus!&quot;. She was angry.\n\nI couldn&#x27;t help myself. My filter was already gone. Excitement was high. I found her preemptive response mildly annoying - I exclaim, in a bit of a sarcastic tone, &quot;Jesus Christ!&quot;. She looks like she is about to kill me. It is too late. Even my aloof friends notice her death glare. I do the equivalent of whistling looking around and pretending nothing happened until she walks away.\n\nWas I in the wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_2172","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for giving an overly exuberant and potentially very rude re","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID636","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID637","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_2172","QuestionID":"QID637","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID638","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for giving an overly exuberant and potentially very rude re","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for giving an overly exuberant and potentially very rude response? Flew to LA with some friends from the east coast to see Hamilton (the play). I was SO excited. Amped up. My buddy and I had seen it on Broadway in New York in April and have been listening to it non stop since then.\n\nThis excitement leads to me to use some very enthusiastic body gestures in the lobby while everyone is coming in and I end up elbowing someone pretty decently. More than a brush but less than a shove. I spun around to apologize as soon as it happened but before I could spit it out the woman I elbowed looked at me and said &quot;Jesus!&quot;. She was angry.\n\nI couldn&#x27;t help myself. My filter was already gone. Excitement was high. I found her preemptive response mildly annoying - I exclaim, in a bit of a sarcastic tone, &quot;Jesus Christ!&quot;. She looks like she is about to kill me. It is too late. Even my aloof friends notice her death glare. I do the equivalent of whistling looking around and pretending nothing happened until she walks away.\n\nWas I in the wrong?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-spac