0","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Which response do you think the writer would be more likely to listen to?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely Response A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably Response A"},"3":{"Display":"About equally likely to listen to both"},"4":{"Display":"Probably Response B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely Response B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID668","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID669","SecondaryAttribute":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would you rather get advice from?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"a_3880","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"If you had a personal problem of your own, which of these two commenters would y","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely commenter A"},"2":{"Display":"Probably commenter A"},"3":{"Display":"No preference"},"4":{"Display":"Probably commenter B"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely commenter B"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID669","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID67","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gB_1030","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Response B","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID67","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID670","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_r_3880","QuestionID":"QID670","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID671","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit o","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit of background information:\nI&#x27;m in a group chat with everyone of my lower school class&#x27; members. Really fun, and really nice to still be in contact with them. However, there&#x27;s 1 guy who isn&#x27;t in the group chat. I heard he&#x27;s a junkie now, and somewhat on the criminal path. Nobody has heard of him for years.\n\nSo, an hour ago, my local police put out a message on their twitter that this particular guy was missing, and there&#x27;s a search team actively looking for him (including a photo of his face). Someone in the group chat made a screenshot of the tweet. The tweet stated that this guy was missing and said he was last seen wearing a black coat, brown pants and white crocs.\n\nWhen reading this, I kinda had to laugh because of the white crocs. This was also my response to the screenshot sent into the group chat:\n\n&#x27;Wow, What?!&#x27;\n&#x27;Kinda had to laugh because of the white crocs tho&#x27;\n&#x27;But damn&#x27;\n\nNow everyone in the group chat is saying I&#x27;m insensitive and there&#x27;s a guy missing, and god knows what happened to him\n\nSo, Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance?<\/div><\/div><p><strong>Do you think the writer was in the wrong?<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"v_75","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit o","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely not in the wrong"},"2":{"Display":"Probably not in the wrong"},"3":{"Display":"Unsure"},"4":{"Display":"Probably in the wrong"},"5":{"Display":"Definitely in the wrong"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID671","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID672","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"t_v_75","QuestionID":"QID672","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":true},"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID673","SecondaryAttribute":"Situation Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit o","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Situation<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit of background information:\nI&#x27;m in a group chat with everyone of my lower school class&#x27; members. Really fun, and really nice to still be in contact with them. However, there&#x27;s 1 guy who isn&#x27;t in the group chat. I heard he&#x27;s a junkie now, and somewhat on the criminal path. Nobody has heard of him for years.\n\nSo, an hour ago, my local police put out a message on their twitter that this particular guy was missing, and there&#x27;s a search team actively looking for him (including a photo of his face). Someone in the group chat made a screenshot of the tweet. The tweet stated that this guy was missing and said he was last seen wearing a black coat, brown pants and white crocs.\n\nWhen reading this, I kinda had to laugh because of the white crocs. This was also my response to the screenshot sent into the group chat:\n\n&#x27;Wow, What?!&#x27;\n&#x27;Kinda had to laugh because of the white crocs tho&#x27;\n&#x27;But damn&#x27;\n\nNow everyone in the group chat is saying I&#x27;m insensitive and there&#x27;s a guy missing, and god knows what happened to him\n\nSo, Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance?<\/div><\/div><p><em>You can re-read the situation above while evaluating the responses.<\/em><\/p><p>Here are two responses to the writer.<\/p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response A<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option A}<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;font-weight:600\">Response B<\/div><div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:visible;height:auto;min-height:4em;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #d9d6cf;padding:12px;line-height:1.45\">${e:\/\/Field\/Option B}<\/div><\/div><\/div><p><strong>Overall, how good is each response?<\/strong><\/p><p>Rate each response:<\/p><p><strong>Response A<\/strong><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"gA_75","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Situation Am I wrong for laughing at my missing childhood acquaintance? So bit o","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Very bad"},"2":{"Display":"Bad"},"3":{"Display":"Somewhat bad"},"4":{"Display":"Neither good nor bad"},"5":{"Display":"Somewhat good"},"6":{"Display":"Good"},"7":{"Display":"Very good"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID673","PrivateData":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_ekvji0xKlx9Ac7Q","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID674","SecondaryAttribute":"Response B","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>Response B<\/strong><\/